[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0223","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0223.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0072","title":"GnuPG gpg 私钥静默导入致信任链破坏漏洞","description":"GnuPG（GPG）1.0.4 及部分其他版本在从公钥服务器导入密钥时，未区分公钥和私钥，也未向用户提示私钥的存在，导致用户可能在不知情的情况下导入他人私钥。攻击者可将恶意私钥上传至公钥服务器，诱使用户导入该私钥，从而破坏信任链（Web of Trust）体系，使得攻击者能够以被窃取私钥的身份进行签名或加密通信。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响 GnuPG 1.0.4 及可能受影响的早期版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0072"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:36Z","remediation":"升级 GnuPG 至 1.0.5 或更高版本，该版本在导入密钥时会区分公钥和私钥并给出明确提示。如无法升级，应避免使用 `--recv-keys` 从公钥服务器自动导入密钥，改为手动验证后导入，并定期使用 `gpg --list-secret-keys` 检查本地私钥列表是否有异常条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000368","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001225b","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/updates/2000/MDKSA-2000-087.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/1702","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-131.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/152197","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2153","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5803","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0072.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0072","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0072.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0072.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/230692da2420d9855e520154fdb81ed9f2cb832a/2001/CVE-2001-0072.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0072.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0072.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0072.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0072.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2001-0072.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0223.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0221","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0221.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0071","title":"GNU GnuPG 分离签名验证绕过漏洞","description":"GnuPG（Gnu Privacy Guard）1.0.4 及部分其他版本在验证分离签名（detached signature）时存在缺陷，未能正确校验签名与文件内容的匹配关系。本地攻击者可在无需认证的情况下，修改已签名文件的内容而不被签名验证机制检测到，导致文件完整性保护失效。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，但需要本地访问权限，影响 GnuPG 的签名验证可信性。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0071"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:36Z","remediation":"升级 GnuPG 至 1.0.5 或更高版本，该版本修复了分离签名验证不完整的问题。对于无法升级的旧系统，应在验证分离签名前手动检查文件完整性，或使用 `gpg --verify` 时配合 `--trust-model always` 参数并交叉校验签名源文件哈希值。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000368","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001225b","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/updates/2000/MDKSA-2000-087.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/1699","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-131.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/152197","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2141","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5802","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0071.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0071","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0071.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0071.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/230692da2420d9855e520154fdb81ed9f2cb832a/2001/CVE-2001-0071.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0071.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0071.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0071.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0071.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2001-0071.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0221.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0217","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0217.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0060","title":"stunnel 格式化字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"stunnel 3.8 及更早版本中存在格式化字符串漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 stunnel 服务发送特制的 ident 用户名，利用格式化字符串处理缺陷执行任意代码。该漏洞源于程序未正确过滤 ident 协议中的用户名字段，导致格式化字符串函数被调用时解析恶意构造的 %n 等格式标记，从而造成内存写入。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。受影响的 stunnel 版本需升级至 3.9 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0060"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:34Z","remediation":"立即升级 stunnel 至 3.9 或更高版本（3.9 于 2000-12-14 发布，修复了 ident 用户名格式化字符串漏洞）。Debian 用户应安装 DSA-009 安全更新，Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2000-129 更新，Conectiva 用户安装对应更新。如无法升级，可在 stunnel 配置中禁用 ident 协议支持（设置 ident = no）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0337.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000363","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-009","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-129.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/151719","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2128","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5807","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2001/CVE-2001-0060.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0060.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0060","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0060.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0060.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/4b74475b4552ac50c2b0e9c897e19d52aaa35c66/2001/CVE-2001-0060.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0060.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0060.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0060.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0060.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0217.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0213","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0213.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0013","title":"ISC BIND 4 nslookupComplain() 格式串溢出漏洞","description":"BIND 4 的 nslookupComplain() 函数中存在格式串漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 DNS 服务器发送包含恶意格式串的特制响应数据包触发该漏洞。该漏洞影响 ISC BIND 4.x 版本，可导致远程攻击者获得 root 权限，进而完全控制目标 DNS 服务器。攻击者可通过构造恶意的 DNS 查询与响应，利用格式串漏洞覆盖内存关键数据，最终实现权限提升和远程代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0013"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:29Z","remediation":"建议立即将 BIND 4 升级至 4.9.8 或更高版本以修复 nslookupComplain() 函数中的格式串漏洞。由于 BIND 4 已终止生命周期且后续不再接收安全更新，强烈建议迁移至当前受支持的 BIND 9 最新稳定版。如短期内无法完成升级，可在防火墙层面限制外部对 DNS 服务的访问，仅允许可信来源发起查询，并监控 named 进程的异常日志输出作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-02.html","http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/047.asp","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-007.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2309","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0013.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0013.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2001/CVE-2001-0013.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0013.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0013","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0013.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0013.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0013.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0013.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb5f9e7ddda132923d86346e273be6f1c71ee410/2001/CVE-2001-0013.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0213.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0210","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0210.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0012","title":"ISC BIND 远程内存信息泄漏漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 4 和 BIND 8 版本存在内存信息泄漏漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标 DNS 服务器发送特制查询请求，触发服务端在响应中泄露内存中的敏感信息（如环境变量、进程数据等）。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 BIND 4.x 和 8.x 版本 DNS 服务器，攻击复杂度低且无需交互，成功利用可导致服务器机密信息外泄，为后续攻击提供辅助信息。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0012"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:29Z","remediation":"立即升级 ISC BIND 至 8.2.3 或更高版本（建议直接迁移至当前维护的 BIND 9.18/9.20 分支）。如暂时无法升级，可通过防火墙限制 DNS 服务端口（UDP/TCP 53）仅允许可信网段访问，并禁用不必要的反向查询功能。BIND 4.x 和 8.1-8.2.2 预发布版本均受影响，建议尽快完成版本迁移以彻底修复此内存信息泄漏漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-02.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-026","http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/047.asp","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-007.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2321","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0012.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/663b7221ac0c437440bcbb2f29bd619793e09cad/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0012.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2001/CVE-2001-0012.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0012","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0012.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0012.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0012.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0012.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb5f9e7ddda132923d86346e273be6f1c71ee410/2001/CVE-2001-0012.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0012.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0210.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0210.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0208","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0011","title":"ISC BIND 4 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"标签中。<value>BIND 4的nslookupComplain函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当远程攻击者向目标DNS服务器发送特制的DNS查询响应报文时，由于函数未对输入数据进行充分的边界检查，可导致堆栈缓冲区溢出。成功利用此漏洞的攻击者能够获得目标系统的root级特权执行权限。该漏洞影响运行BIND 4.x版本的DNS服务器，攻击者无需身份认证即可在网络中发起远程攻击。攻击者可通过构造包含恶意数据的DNS响应包，触发目标系统的缓冲区溢出，从而完全控制受影响的DNS服务器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0011"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:29Z","remediation":"立即升级到BIND 9.x或更高版本，停止使用已受影响的BIND 4.x版本。如无法立即升级，可通过删除nslookupComplain函数或限制对nslookup服务的访问来临时缓解风险，并及时应用Red Hat安全更新RHSA-2001-007。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-02.html","http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/047.asp","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-007.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2307","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0011.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/663b7221ac0c437440bcbb2f29bd619793e09cad/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0011.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2001/CVE-2001-0011.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0011.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0011","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0011.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0011.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0011.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0011.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3979a7633898f20f850131e08d621fa27d545855/2001/CVE-2001-0011.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0043","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0100","title":"Brian Stanback bslist.cgi 1.0 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Brian Stanback 开发的 bslist.cgi 1.0 邮件列表管理脚本存在输入验证漏洞，该脚本未能正确过滤用户提交的电子邮件地址中的分号（;）等 shell 元字符，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向邮件列表注册功能提交特制的邮箱地址注入任意 shell 命令，以 Web 服务器权限执行恶意操作，如窃取敏感文件或发送垃圾邮件。攻击者只需能够访问该 CGI 脚本的 Web 页面即可触发漏洞，利用门槛极低。该漏洞影响所有使用 bslist.cgi 1.0 版本的 Web 服务器，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0100"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:39Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 bslist.cgi 1.0，该脚本已不再维护且厂商官网已不提供下载。彻底删除服务器上所有 bslist.cgi 文件，或移除 CGI 执行权限（`chmod -x bslist.cgi`）。如必须保留邮件列表功能，改用现代替代方案（如 Mailman 3 或 Sympa），并在 Web 服务器层面配置输入过滤规则，拦截包含 `;`、`|`、`&` 等 shell 元字符的请求参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0390.html","http://www.stanback.net/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5797","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20525","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0100.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0100.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0100","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0100.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0100.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0100.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2001/CVE-2001-0100.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0100.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0100.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0100.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0043.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0043.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0043.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0042","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0042.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0099","title":"Brian Stanback bsguest.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"bsguest.cgi 留言簿脚本 1.0 版本在处理用户输入的电子邮件地址时，未对 shell 元字符（如管道符、分号等）进行有效过滤，导致远程攻击者可通过向该脚本提交特制的恶意邮件地址参数注入任意系统命令。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用该漏洞，成功利用后可完全控制目标服务器，执行任意命令，造成信息泄露、数据篡改或服务中断等严重后果。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级为严重，Exploit-DB 上已有公开利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0099"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:39Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 bsguest.cgi 脚本，该软件已停止维护且无安全更新。如必须使用，需在 email 字段中过滤 shell 元字符（如 `;` `|` `&` `$` `` ` ``），使用 `escapeshellcmd()` 或正则白名单校验输入，并将 Web 服务器以最低权限用户运行以限制命令执行影响范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0390.html","http://www.stanback.net/","https://exchange.xforce.