ITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0098"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:39Z","remediation":"升级 BEA WebLogic Server 至 5.1.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 5.1.0 中修复。对于已停止维护的旧版本，建议迁移至 Oracle WebLogic Server 受支持版本（如 12.2.1.4 或 14.1.1.0），并在 Web 服务器或 WAF 层面过滤包含连续双点（\"..\"）的畸形 URL 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0331.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2138","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5782","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20516","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0098.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0098.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0098","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0098.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0098.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0098.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2001/CVE-2001-0098.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0098.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0098.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0098.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0041.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0041.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0041.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0040","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0097","title":"Infinite InterChange 3.6.1 Web 接口 POST 请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Infinite InterChange 3.6.1 的 Web 管理界面存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送特制的大尺寸 POST 请求，导致应用程序崩溃。该漏洞源于 Web 接口未对 POST 请求体大小进行有效限制，当处理超大数据量时触发内存分配失败或缓冲区溢出，造成服务进程异常终止。攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可实施攻击，无需任何权限或用户交互。Exploit-DB 已公开 PoC 利用代码，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0097"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:38Z","remediation":"建议升级 Infinite InterChange 至 3.61 以上版本，或联系厂商获取安全补丁。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层面限制 POST 请求体大小（如限制为 1MB），并配置 WAF 规则拦截超长 POST 请求以缓解拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/152403","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2140","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5798","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20518","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0097.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0097.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0097","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0097.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0097.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0097.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2001/CVE-2001-0097.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0097.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0097.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0097.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0040.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0040.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0039","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0095","title":"Sun Solaris catman 本地符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.7 和 2.8 系统中的 catman 工具在处理临时文件时存在不安全的符号链接（symlink）竞争条件漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp 目录下预创建恶意的 sman_PID 符号链接，诱使 catman 以 root 权限向攻击者指定的任意文件写入数据，从而实现任意文件覆盖。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要本地访问权限且依赖时序竞争条件，CVSS 评分 1.2，危害等级低。建议升级到不受影响的 Solaris 版本或限制 catman 的 suid 权限。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0095"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:38Z","remediation":"Solaris 2.7 和 2.8 已停止维护，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议升级至受支持的 Solaris 10/11 或迁移至 Oracle Solaris 11.4 SRU。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户登录权限，使用 `umask 077` 保护临时目录，或通过 `solaris.symlink_hardlink` 安全策略限制符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0313.html","http://www.osvdb.org/6024","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5788","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/233","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0095.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0095.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0095"