dated":"2026-06-16T21:53:37Z","remediation":"建议立即禁用 Fast Mode 功能，在防火墙策略配置中取消勾选 \"Accept Fast Mode\" 选项，或通过命令行执行 `fw fastmode off` 关闭该加速模式。同时升级 Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 至 4.1 SP3 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在网络边界部署入侵检测系统，对畸形分片 TCP 报文进行拦截过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0271.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20519","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0082.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0082.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0082","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0082.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0082.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0082.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2001/CVE-2001-0082.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0082.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0082.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/27ef30b72e2251e5a09f792eabf726cf380537a6/api/2001/CVE-2001-0082.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0034.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0034.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0033","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0080","title":"Cisco Catalyst 4000/Catalyst 5000/Catalyst 6000 SSH 协议不匹配拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco Catalyst 4000/5000/6000 系列交换机的 SSH 服务存在协议不匹配拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需通过非 SSH 客户端连接目标交换机的 SSH 端口（默认 22），即可触发协议协商错误，导致 SSH 服务进程崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 Cisco IOS 6.1 及之前版本的 Catalyst 系列交换机，攻击条件低，仅需网络可达即可实施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0080"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:37Z","remediation":"建议将 Cisco Catalyst 4000/5000/6000 系列交换机升级至 CatOS 6.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SSH 协议不匹配导致的设备重置问题。如无法立即升级，可在交换机 ACL 中限制 SSH 端口（TCP 22）的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理主机连接，防止非 SSH 客户端连接触发拒绝服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/catalyst-ssh-protocolmismatch-pub.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2117","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5760","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20509","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2001/CVE-2001-0080.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0080.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0080.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0080","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0080.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0080.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0080.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0080.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abb3d9c240bc75ee9d5885882897d780d10d15cb/2001/